<% canonical = "https://smarts.md#{@chain.path}" %>
<% reference = "chains/#{@chain.slug}" %>

# <%= @chain.name %>

- **Chain ID:** `<%= @chain.chain_id %>`
- **Tier:** <%= @chain.full? ? "live" : "docs-only" %>
<% if @chain.docs_url.present? %>
- **Docs:** <%= @chain.docs_url %>
<% end %>

<%= @chain.summary %>

<% if @chain.docs_only? %>
> Indexed source, ABI, and contract references.
<% else %>
> This is a live chain on Smarts. Contract pages can surface live on-chain state, recent activity, and admin controls.
<% end %>

## Query via AI agent

- **MCP endpoint:** `https://smarts.md/mcp`
- **Reference:** `<%= reference %>`
- **Sample prompt:** "Show me the supported contracts on <%= @chain.name %> and summarize the highest-signal ones."

<% if @chain.contracts.any? %>
## Contracts

